1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,160
Narrator: Listen to a principal talking to a group of students.

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:09,110
Principal: I was not impressed with your behavior during today's talent show.

3
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:13,150
Those were your friends and classmates who were performing on stage.

4
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:16,060
It was very rude of you to talk loudly

5
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:19,180
and send text messages throughout the performance.

6
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:22,070
An audience should not act that way.

7
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:25,160
I'm very disappointed in you.
